Game Introduction
Recycle Shop is a 2D factory simulation game that places the player at the heart of a recycling facility. Raw waste materials arrive on a conveyor belt, and it is the player's job to sort them into the correct recycling bins, scrub them clean with the right tools, process them through a recycling machine, and finally craft entirely new products from the recovered materials. Set in a cheerful industrial world of clanking belts and bubbling cleaning solutions, the game challenges players to think quickly, work methodically, and make smart crafting decisions — all while racing to maximise their earnings at the market.

